pingora  --  upstream dependency, not vendored
================================================================================

  Author:     Cloudflare, Inc.
  Repository: https://github.com/cloudflare/pingora
  Licence:    Apache-2.0
  Version:    0.8.1, from crates.io

  Consumed as a normal cargo dependency with the `lb`, `openssl`, and `cache`
