================================================================================
pingora-waf  --  detector source material, not vendored as a crate
================================================================================

  Author:     AarambhDevHub
  Repository: https://github.com/AarambhDevHub/pingora-waf
  Licence:    Apache-2.0
  Commit:     a316b22997946b3fd3c484e00ee32d1d6cfc9de9  (2025-12-13)

  This project is absorbed as source material, not as a dependency or a second
  process. Its `src/waf/*` detectors are copied file-by-file into
  `crates/pingap-waf` and ported to the pingora 0.8.1 API; each ported file
  carries its own attribution header naming this commit.

  Not carried over: `src/proxy/mod.rs`, `src/main.rs`, `src/config/`,
  `src/metrics/`, and `rate_limiter.rs`. pingap owns the single `ProxyHttp`
  implementation and its existing `limit` plugin supersedes the rate limiter.

